WEBVTT

00:07:29.002 --> 00:07:30.216
is not.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.067
OK, third rule,

00:07:32.091 --> 00:07:33.801
and I really mean this one:

00:07:33.825 --> 00:07:36.503
please do not ask for help

00:07:36.527 --> 00:07:38.819
over email or text.

00:07:39.351 --> 00:07:41.964
Really, seriously, please don't.

00:07:41.988 --> 00:07:44.182
Email and text are impersonal.

00:07:44.206 --> 00:07:46.972
I realize sometimes
there's no alternative,

00:07:46.996 --> 00:07:49.488
but mostly what happens is,

00:07:49.512 --> 00:07:52.485
we like to ask for help
over email and text

00:07:52.509 --> 00:07:56.026
because it feels less awkward
for us to do so.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.475
You know what else feels
less awkward over email and text?